    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main 835556814a: PR #3505 updates all three tests named in this issue. The tests expected no inherited pose before the first lean. They now expect the upright home pose Some([0.0, 0.0, 1.0]).\n\nPR #3505 reports multiaxis (7 tests), multiaxis_avoid (6 tests), and multiaxis_rough (5 tests) passing, plus clean motion clippy. I checked the merged diff and current upstream main through the GitHub API. I did not rerun the tests locally or claim this issue.\n\nLikely fix: merge commit 835556814a9dc79ce7669320f402184b8ac7f8af, PR #3505. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n",
